{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Status 2026-11-19 PST: Gerrit 3460 patch set 2 (01a6c22039f) is blocked by LLM-Review -1. Verified +1. make verify passed on both patch sets. Not merged, so this ticket stays in_progress.\n\nBlocking finding (standing since patch set 1): with enforcement on, the gate passes an event signed by any key that verifies against itself, so the gate no longer authenticates authorship. That is the decided policy, not a defect in the implementation. Patch set 2 records it as an amendment to ADR 0045 and in the verify-identity help, and the inline replies say so. The bot blocks again regardless, so landing needs an operator decision.\n\nAdvisory findings still open on patch set 2:\n- A revoked key that is on the keyring gives key_not_valid_at_era and fails, while a key the identity never held passes as signer-not-on-keyring. Revoking a key therefore does not keep its holder from passing the gate: they can sign with any new key. The rule as stated leaves this asymmetry; the history has 0 such events.\n- Missing test: a null-signer ledger entry with a genuinely bad signature. The test change in patch set 1 replaced the old one.\n- Scope: verify.py, the generated help files and ADR 0045 were edited outside the declared file_impact.\n\nPre-merge build counts (branch build 461e4a9d375; this verifier code is unchanged in patch set 2), enforced `verify-identity --all`, no enforce_since:\n- Rewritten dry-run history (shadow fb999892b1e): 43,518 verified, 874 unsigned, 0 unknown-author, 0 bad-signature, 0 key-not-valid-at-era, 6,101 signer-not-on-keyring (50,493 in scope). Exit 1, from the 874 unsigned events only.\n- Original history (b878d77e28d): identical counts. Exit 1, same cause.\n- The 6,101 findings name 2 keys, SHA256:biqEFL9T969c… (3,344) and SHA256:YWib9Gj1qZ+x… (2,757).\n- The merged-build run is not done, because nothing has merged."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795122483319321001,"uuid":"af3c231d-a9dc-47ac-9ba6-b6dc49cecc9e"}